- **Name:** Agnes 2.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Local metadata describes Agnes 2.5 Flash as a Sapiens AI high-throughput flash-tier MoE model with 512K context, tool calling, prompt caching, and adaptive thinking (text+image in; text out), but this identity/specification could not be independently verified from accessible public sources in this pass.
